<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review - USDA - Oct 25.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review - USDA - Oct 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Services.</p>
<p>Prices as of October 25, 1996</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mixed, mostly 5 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was steady to 5.00 lower.  Crude Sunflower Oil was steady to 25 points higher.</p>
